--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Responses can repeat a header: `Response.headers` is now a list of
+  `(name, value)` pairs, with `add_header()`, `set_header()` and
+  `header_values()`. Setting several cookies keeps every `Set-Cookie`.
 - Error responses carry a stable code: the body is now
   `{"error": {"code": ..., "message": ...}, "status": ...}`. `HTTPError`
   subclasses set `code`, defaulting to `http_<status>`. `ClientError.message`
